<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Sky transparency — night reports</title>
<style>
{{.CSS}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<h1>Sky transparency — night reports</h1>
<p class="sub">One self-contained report per imaging night, published from the observatory each morning:
how much of a normal night got through, and which failures were the sky's fault. {{.Count}} nights so far, newest first.</p>
{{range .Months}}<div class="card">
  <h2>{{.Label}}</h2>
  <div>
{{range .Nights}}    <a class="night" href="{{.File}}"><time>{{.Label}}</time><span><span class="sum">{{.Summary}}</span>{{if .Pills}}<span class="pills">{{range .Pills}}<span class="pill">{{.}}</span>{{end}}</span>{{end}}</span></a>
{{end}}  </div>
</div>
{{end}}{{if not .Months}}<div class="card"><p class="note">No reports yet.</p></div>
{{end}}<p class="foot">Reports are generated by skyq from the N.I.N.A. log and the all-sky camera. Transparency is advisory only.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
